0	AAAAAAAAAAAA	ok	ok	0	3
0	AAGAAAAAAAAA	ok	ok	1	4
1	TTTTTTTTTCTT	ok	ok	1	4
1	TTTTTTTTTTTT	ok	ok	0	3

